"Emails must only contain the subject-line, when the english email template "
"also contains it::"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:141
msgid ""
"Emails must only contain the ``{EMAIL_SIG}``, when the english email "
"template also contains it. Additional the ``{EMAIL_SIG}`` must always be on "
"it's own line, must be the last line of text and is followed by an empty new "
"line."
msgstr ""
"Emails must only contain the ``{EMAIL_SIG}``, when the english email "
"template also contains it. Additional the ``{EMAIL_SIG}`` must always be on "
"it's own line, must be the last line of text and is followed by an empty new "
"line."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:144
msgid ""
"Emails should use all variables that are provided in the english email "
"template, in order to provide the same information to the user."
msgstr ""
"Emails should use all variables that are provided in the english email "
"template, in order to provide the same information to the user."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:146
msgid ""
"Emails may only contain ``{U_BOARD}``, ``{EMAIL_SIG}`` and ``{SITENAME}`` as "
"additional variables. No other variables are available."
msgstr ""
"Emails may only contain ``{U_BOARD}``, ``{EMAIL_SIG}`` and ``{SITENAME}`` as "
"additional variables. No other variables are available."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:148
msgid "Emails must not use HTML content."
msgstr "Emails must not use HTML content."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/language/validation.rst:149
msgid "There must be an empty new line at the end of the file."
msgstr "There must be an empty new line at the end of the file."

